          <data key="d100">Nitric oxide synthase, inducible</data>
          <data key="d101">Hepatocyte NOS; Inducible NO synthase; NOS type II; Peptidyl-cysteine S-nitrosylase NOS2</data>
          <data key="d104">Produces nitric oxide (NO) which is a messenger molecule with diverse functions throughout the body. In macrophages, NO mediates tumoricidal and bactericidal actions.</data>
