            <node id="n2::n0::n0">
              <data key="d100">Tyrosine-protein kinase JAK1</data>
              <data key="d101">Janus kinase 1</data>
              <data key="d104">Non-membrane spanning protein tyrosine kinase that phosphorylates signal-transducing subunits of cytokine receptor complexes like IL2RB, IL10RA, IFNAR2, IL6ST, LIFR, OSMR and IL31RA. Functionally, is involved in the IFN-alpha/beta/gamma signal pathway.</data>
