              <data key="d101">Interferon gamma receptor accessory factor 1; Interferon gamma receptor beta-chain; Interferon gamma transducer 1</data>
              <data key="d104">Associates with IFNGR1 to form a receptor for the cytokine interferon gamma (IFNG). Ligand binding stimulates activation of the JAK/STAT signaling pathway.</data>
