            <node id="n2::n2::n4">
              <data key="d100">Tyrosine-protein kinase JAK2</data>
              <data key="d101">Janus kinase 2</data>
              <data key="d104">Non-membrane spanning protein tyrosine kinase that phosphorylates type I receptors such as growth hormone (GHR), prolactin (PRLR), leptin (LEPR), erythropoietin (EPOR), thrombopoietin receptor (MPL/TPOR); or type II receptors including IFN-alpha, IFN-beta, IFN-gamma and multiple interleukins. Functionally, plays a pivotal role in signal transduction and is involved in various processes such as cell growth, development, differentiation or histone modifications.</data>
              <data key="d105">Endomembrane system, Cytoplasm, Nucleus</data>
              <data key="d107">HGNC:6192</data>
              <data key="d108">JAK2</data>
